00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:29.730
...can do whatever they want.

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:39.300
As long as we have courage and still believe, the spirits will live on inside all of us!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:43.440
Not much longer. Not much longer.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:48.890
Well, I believe that we're in big trouble!

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:53.810
Sure hope there's something left to fight for on the next Digimon Digital Monsters!
